{
  "info": {
    "name": "Dine Restaurant API",
    "description": "餐廳訂位系統 API。規則編號（BR-xx）對應 `docs/規格書_v1.xlsx` 的 Rules 工作表。\n\n## 使用方式\n1. 匯入本 Collection 與 Environment（Local 或 Production），右上角選擇環境。\n2. 依序執行，或用 Collection Runner 一次跑完：Create reservation 會建立一筆訂位，Admin 資料夾最後會把它刪掉。\n\n## 共通規則\n- 錯誤格式一律為 `{ \"error\": \"代碼\" }`；欄位錯誤另有 `fields`。\n- `401` 一律代表需要重新登入。\n- 網址結尾**不要加 `/`**，例如 `/api/admin/reservations/` 會回 404。\n- 「今天」以台灣時間（UTC+8）計算，可預約明天起 30 天內。\n- **CORS**：只有後端 `CORS_ORIGINS` 設定列出的前端網址能從瀏覽器呼叫，新的前端網址請先請後端加入。Postman 不受 CORS 限制。\n- 後台 API 用 `Authorization: Bearer <token>` 驗證，token 由 Login 取得。\n\n## 自動變數\n- `bookingDate`：每次送出前自動算成 D+3（台灣時間），範例不會因日期過期而失效。\n- `phone`：Create reservation 每次隨機產生，避免重複訂位。\n- `reservationId`：Create reservation 成功後自動記下，給 Delete reservation 使用。\n- `adminToken`：Login 成功後自動記下，Admin 資料夾的請求會自動帶上。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// bookingDate = 台灣時間的 D+3（YYYY-MM-DD）",
          "const d = new Date(Date.now() + 8 * 3600 * 1000);",
          "d.setUTCDate(d.getUTCDate() + 3);",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('bookingDate', d.toISOString().slice(0, 10));"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "bookingDate",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "phone",
      "value": "0912345678"
    },
    {
      "key": "reservationId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Public",
      "description": "前台 API，不需登入。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get availability",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('回傳 4 個時段', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().slots).to.have.lengthOf(4));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/availability?date={{bookingDate}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "availability"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "date",
                  "value": "{{bookingDate}}",
                  "description": "YYYY-MM-DD"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "查詢某一天各時段的剩餘名額（BR-12），以及可預約的日期範圍（BR-04）。\n\n- `range.min` / `range.max`：可預約範圍（台灣時間，明天起 30 天內），前端請用它限制日期選擇器。\n- 這支 API **不檢查日期是否在可預約範圍內**，範圍外的日期也會回傳名額。\n- `remaining <= 0` 代表額滿，請停用該時段並顯示 `Full`。"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 成功",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/availability?date={{bookingDate}}",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "availability"
                  ],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "key": "date",
                      "value": "{{bookingDate}}",
                      "description": "YYYY-MM-DD"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"date\": \"2026-10-26\",\n  \"range\": {\n    \"min\": \"2026-10-24\",\n    \"max\": \"2026-11-22\"\n  },\n  \"maxGuests\": 10,\n  \"slots\": [\n    {\n      \"slot\": \"11:30\",\n      \"remaining\": 20\n    },\n    {\n      \"slot\": \"12:30\",\n      \"remaining\": 5\n    },\n    {\n      \"slot\": \"17:30\",\n      \"remaining\": 0\n    },\n    {\n      \"slot\": \"18:30\",\n      \"remaining\": 20\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 日期格式錯誤",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/availability?date=2026-02-30",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "availability"
                  ],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "key": "date",
                      "value": "2026-02-30"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\",\n  \"fields\": {\n    \"date\": \"INVALID_DATE\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Create reservation",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// 每次產生不同的電話，避免重複執行時撞到 DUPLICATE",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('phone', '09' + String(Math.floor(Math.random() * 1e8)).padStart(8, '0'));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) pm.collectionVariables.set('reservationId', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/reservations",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "reservations"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Amy\",\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"date\": \"{{bookingDate}}\",\n  \"slot\": \"12:30\",\n  \"guests\": 2\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "建立訂位（BR-01 ~ BR-08）。\n\n| 欄位 | 型別 | 規則 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| name | string | 必填 |\n| phone | string | 必填，09 開頭共 10 碼數字 |\n| date | string | 必填，YYYY-MM-DD，明天起 30 天內 |\n| slot | string | 必填，`11:30`、`12:30`、`17:30`、`18:30` 其中之一 |\n| guests | **number** | 必填，1–10 的整數。**送字串 \"2\" 會被當成錯誤** |\n\n`fields` 錯誤代碼：\n\n| 欄位 | 可能的代碼 |\n| --- | --- |\n| name | REQUIRED |\n| phone | REQUIRED、INVALID_PHONE |\n| date | REQUIRED、INVALID_DATE、OUT_OF_RANGE |\n| slot | REQUIRED、INVALID_SLOT |\n| guests | REQUIRED、OUT_OF_RANGE |\n\n代碼要顯示成什麼文字，以規格書「UI 文案」欄為準。"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 成功",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/reservations",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "reservations"
                  ]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Amy\",\n  \"phone\": \"0912345678\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-10-26\",\n  \"slot\": \"12:30\",\n  \"guests\": 2\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"Amy\",\n  \"phone\": \"0912345678\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-10-26\",\n  \"slot\": \"12:30\",\n  \"guests\": 2\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 欄位錯誤",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/reservations",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "reservations"
                  ]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"\",\n  \"phone\": \"0812345678\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-10-26\",\n  \"slot\": \"12:30\",\n  \"guests\": \"2\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\",\n  \"fields\": {\n    \"name\": \"REQUIRED\",\n    \"phone\": \"INVALID_PHONE\",\n    \"guests\": \"OUT_OF_RANGE\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "409 名額不足",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/reservations",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "reservations"
                  ]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Amy\",\n  \"phone\": \"0912345678\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-10-26\",\n  \"slot\": \"12:30\",\n  \"guests\": 6\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "status": "Conflict",
              "code": 409,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"SLOT_FULL\",\n  \"remaining\": 5\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "409 重複訂位",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/reservations",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "reservations"
                  ]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Amy\",\n  \"phone\": \"0912345678\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-10-26\",\n  \"slot\": \"12:30\",\n  \"guests\": 2\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "status": "Conflict",
              "code": 409,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"DUPLICATE\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin",
      "description": "後台 API。先執行 Login，之後的請求會自動帶上 `Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}`。",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [
          {
            "key": "token",
            "value": "{{adminToken}}",
            "type": "string"
          }
        ]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', pm.response.json().token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "admin",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{adminUser}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPass}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "後台登入（BR-09）。成功回 `{ token, expiresIn }`。\n\n- **外部前端**：之後的後台請求加上標頭 `Authorization: Bearer <token>`。本 Collection 會自動把 token 存進 `{{adminToken}}` 並帶上。\n- token 有效 8 小時（`expiresIn` 單位為秒），無法提前作廢；登出時請前端自行丟棄 token。\n- 同時也會設定 `admin_session` cookie（`HttpOnly`、`SameSite=Strict`），只給同網域的內建後台頁面使用，跨網站不會送出。\n- 帳號或密碼錯誤一律回 `401`，不區分是哪一項錯。",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 成功",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/login",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "admin",
                    "login"
                  ]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{adminUser}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPass}}\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                },
                {
                  "key": "Set-Cookie",
                  "value": "admin_session=<JWT>; Max-Age=28800; Path=/; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Strict"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"token\": \"<JWT>\",\n  \"expiresIn\": 28800\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 帳密錯誤",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/login",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "admin",
                    "login"
                  ]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"wrong\"\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"UNAUTHORIZED\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "List reservations",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('items 是陣列', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().items).to.be.an('array'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reservations?date={{bookingDate}}&q=",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "admin",
                "reservations"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "date",
                  "value": "{{bookingDate}}",
                  "description": "選填，YYYY-MM-DD"
                },
                {
                  "key": "q",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "選填，部分比對姓名或電話",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "訂位列表（BR-10），需登入。\n\n- `date`、`q` 都是選填，可以一起用；`q` 是部分比對，`0912` 也能找到 `0912345678`。\n- 排序固定為日期 → 時段 → id。\n- `created_at` 是 **UTC 時間**，顯示時請轉成台灣時間（+8）。"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 成功",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reservations?date=2026-10-26",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "admin",
                    "reservations"
                  ],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "key": "date",
                      "value": "2026-10-26"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"name\": \"Amy\",\n      \"phone\": \"0912345678\",\n      \"date\": \"2026-10-26\",\n      \"slot\": \"12:30\",\n      \"guests\": 2,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-23 08:30:00\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 未登入",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reservations?date={{bookingDate}}&q=",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "admin",
                    "reservations"
                  ],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "key": "date",
                      "value": "{{bookingDate}}",
                      "description": "選填，YYYY-MM-DD"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "q",
                      "value": "",
                      "description": "選填，部分比對姓名或電話",
                      "disabled": true
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"UNAUTHORIZED\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete reservation",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
